% 4. Skia-style unclosed rectangle under a flipped matrix
q
0.75 0 0 -0.75 50 155 cm
0 0 m
400 0 l
400 1 l
0 1 l
f
Q
% 5. Unclosed rectangle whose last point lies on its implicit closing edge
q
45 0 0 0.8 50 100 cm
0 0 m
2 0 l
2 1 l
0 1 l
0 0.1 l
f
Q
% 6. Vertical rule
149.6 125 0.8 25 re f
% 7. Rectangles of other sizes
300 60 40 20 re f
50 60 5 0.5 re f
50 80 100 3.6 re f
% 8. Rectangle in a path with a curved subpath
50 10 300 0.5 re
370 10 m
370 15 380 15 380 10 c
380 5 370 5 370 10 c
h
